    {
      "page_idx": 14,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 0,
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "一、上海的城市意象"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 1,
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "image_body",
              "index": 1,
              "image_path": "images/page_14_image_1.jpg",
              "content": ""
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 2,
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "上海是一个新兴的旅游目的地，这就要归功于它深厚的文化底蕴与众多的历史古迹，如上海的地标：浦西的外滩与新天地。位于浦东的东方明珠广播电视塔与金茂大厦却呈现出另一番繁华景象，它们与上海环球金融中心等建筑共同组成了全球最壮丽的天际线之一为“东方巴黎”添上灿烂的一笔。 昔日的上海烙印着 “十里洋场”的繁华，讲述着旧上海滩的浮华旧梦。外滩的夜景值得一看。商业发达，交通便利。美食方面推荐浓油赤酱的本帮菜，也可以去城隍庙品尝地道的上海小吃。上海迪斯尼乐园也于2015年开张。",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page_idx": 15,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 0,
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "image_body",
              "index": 0,
              "image_path": "images/page_15_image_0.jpg",
              "content": ""
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 1,
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "image_body",
              "index": 1,
              "image_path": "images/page_15_image_1.jpg",
              "content": ""
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 2,
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "上海热销门票排名前几位分别为：外滩，东方明珠，老城隍庙，南京路，田子坊，朱家角等，",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "上海迪士尼并不在热销排行",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page_idx": 16,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 0,
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "二、上海迪士尼的游客感知"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 1,
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "image_body",
              "index": 1,
              "image_path": "images/page_16_image_1.jpg",
              "content": ""
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 2,
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "image_body",
              "index": 2,
              "image_path": "images/page_16_image_2.jpg",
              "content": ""
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 3,
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "image_body",
              "index": 3,
              "image_path": "images/page_16_image_3.jpg",
              "content": ""
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "当你坐了5-6个小时高铁/2个小时飞机，愉快地到达上海后，再坐1个多小时汽车到达迪士尼，你会发现大门口是这样的！",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page_idx": 17,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 0,
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "上海迪士尼入园园规"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 1,
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "image_body",
              "index": 1,
              "image_path": "images/page_17_image_1.jpg",
              "content": ""
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 2,
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "16周岁及以上游客不可穿卡通、电影、漫画中角色服装，不可穿及地长衣 　　年满16周岁及以上游客不可佩戴口罩，戴口罩不得遮盖双眼 　　不能带自拍杆，不能带大型三脚架、折叠椅与凳子 　　不能带食物及酒精饮料 　　不能带有滑轮的游乐装备，如旱冰鞋、滑板车等",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page_idx": 18,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 0,
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "image_body",
              "index": 0,
              "image_path": "images/page_18_image_0.jpg",
              "content": ""
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 1,
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "image_body",
              "index": 1,
              "image_path": "images/page_18_image_1.jpg",
              "content": ""
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 2,
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "不许带自拍杆！喝过的水，不是原包装的不能带！",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "面包鸡蛋黄瓜饼干之类的食品也不能带！饿了只能在园内买！",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page_idx": 19,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 0,
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "image_body",
              "index": 0,
              "image_path": "images/page_19_image_0.jpg",
              "content": ""
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 1,
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "image_body",
              "index": 1,
