            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "迪士尼明日世界的星露台餐厅用餐后的账单：",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "1份汉堡套餐+1份炸鸡套餐+1份儿童餐，共消费210元！",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page_idx": 20,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 0,
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "image_body",
              "index": 0,
              "image_path": "images/page_20_image_0.jpg",
              "content": ""
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 1,
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "几乎所有餐厅的正餐套餐都在七、八十元，包含一份主食+一杯饮料，食材稍好的（牛排、猪肋等），要价都在百元左右！",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page_idx": 21,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 0,
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "image_body",
